  "network.guide_text": "📡 NETWORK CONNECTION — GUIDE\n\n1. ADMIN (at the office):\n   • Open the « Network » tab\n   • Your IP is displayed automatically — share it with teachers\n   • Set the port and encryption password\n   • Click « Start » — the server starts\n   • Add teachers to the list (name + IP)\n   • Teachers who have sent data show « Data available » status\n\n2. TEACHER (in class):\n   • Open the « Connection » tab\n   • Your IP is displayed — give it to admin if needed\n   • Enter the admin IP and your name\n   • Enter the encryption password (same as admin's)\n   • Click « Connect »\n\n3. SENDING ASSIGNMENTS:\n   • Go to « Assignments » tab\n   • Select a class and subject\n   • Add assignments and enter grades\n   • Click « 🌐 Send to admin »\n\n4. IMPORTING (admin):\n   • In the teacher list, look for « Data available »\n   • Go to « Assignments » tab\n   • Use the « 🌐 Network » button to import received data",

